  crossing identity (joint - sum) = -2.274e-12   (tolerance 1.0e-06)   VERIFIED
  rung 1  (F diag, Theta diag, Sigma free)   logL = -32.1384907609
  rung 2  (F free, Theta free, Sigma free)   logL = -12.8844355915

